1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:12,890
Is this... a breakthrough to Nascent Soul ?

25
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,490
With such momentum,

26
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:18,130
this person is sure to become strong in the future.

27
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:21,450
Sect Leader, will this person participate in the ceremony

28
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,050
so we can meet them ?

29
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:29,330
Could it... be an outsider

30
00:02:29,120 --> 00:02:32,210
exploiting this blessed environment to breakthrough ?

31
00:02:32,160 --> 00:02:34,130
They have so many Elders here

32
00:02:33,880 --> 00:02:36,050
and none of them noticed until now ?

33
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,130
This is interesting.

34
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:39,730
Everyone stay calm.

35
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,490
In ten breaths,

36
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:44,810
I will capture this thief alive.

37
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:48,010
Let's see.

38
00:02:54,070 --> 00:02:55,650
Is this your doing ?

39
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:58,730
All the elders of the Cloud Sky Sect are here.

40
00:02:58,520 --> 00:03:00,610
Whoever he is,

41
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:02,090
he will die today.

42
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:15,410
Elder Liu !

43
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,810
Such spiritual energy fluctuations...

44
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:23,170
He isn't here to chat.

45
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,250
Who is this person ?

46
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:44,490
Wang Lin
Early stage Nascent Soul

47
00:03:55,880 --> 00:03:58,250
Junior, who are you ?

48
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:01,050
Come.

49
00:04:20,540 --> 00:04:27,770
Don't wait for the future love,

50
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:34,490
the soul between your eyebrows is already peaceful.

51
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,330
Senior,

52
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:31,610
save me.

53
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,850
She's mine !

54
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:33,410
Senior !

55
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:43,110
I asked the palm lines of time.

56
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:49,890
Sincerely entrust your love, don't waste time.

57
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:49,530
Wan'er knows that Senior has his own goals.

58
00:04:49,750 --> 00:04:52,650
The cultivation path is extremely dangerous

59
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:55,120
but I hope that if you encounter danger in the future,

60
00:04:54,940 --> 00:04:57,050
this formation can delay it for a moment.

61
00:04:50,600 --> 00:04:54,370
I promised in my dreams

62
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:58,170
that from now on no one will block our path.

63
00:04:57,960 --> 00:05:04,380
In the blink of an eye, I will change the world.

64
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,690
Killing Sun Zhenwei is easy.

65
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,730
But we have to wait

66
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:08,650
for my cultivation to be high enough so no one can oppose us

67
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:10,810
both in the Cloud Sky Sect and in Chu.

68
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,730
Sounds good ?

69
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:16,640
In all these nights of longing for the past,

70
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:20,260
deep in my heart

71
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:22,290
I believed that you and I

72
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:26,370
can cross the line between life and death.

73
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:31,530
We will overcome our doomed fate.

74
00:05:31,290 --> 00:05:34,810
The night won't last forever.

75
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:35,450
Bitch !

76
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,970
Do you believe

77
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:38,530
Do you have a death wish ?

78
00:05:38,280 --> 00:05:39,650
I'll kill you !

79
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:41,410
in the unbreakable reincarnation cycle ?

80
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:47,280
Die.

81
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,850
How dare you !?

82
00:05:57,850 --> 00:06:00,290
Insignificant little newborn Nascent Soul,

83
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,040
you will pay with your life !

84
00:06:03,400 --> 00:06:04,290
Die !

85
00:06:08,560 --> 00:06:13,010
After seeing your longing eyes,

86
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:16,870
I want to keep them in my heart

87
00:06:16,650 --> 00:06:18,260
to guard them

88
00:06:18,050 --> 00:06:23,220
from the reincarnation cycle.

89
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:28,010
When I saw your beautiful face

90
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:29,700
This is my personal affair with the Cloud Sky Sect.

91
00:06:29,510 --> 00:06:31,170
If anyone dares to intervene,

92
00:06:27,760 --> 00:06:31,330
on our first meeting,

93
00:06:31,080 --> 00:06:33,170
I believed

94
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,520
don't blame me for being ruthless.

95
00:06:33,920 --> 00:06:35,170
If you wish to leave now,

96
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,650
I won't stop you.

97
00:06:36,400 --> 00:06:37,650
Farewell then.

98
00:06:37,560 --> 00:06:38,810
Let's go, quick !

99
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:38,740
that fate will never destroy our vows.

100
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:44,610
I have contacted the Ancestors,

101
00:06:44,620 --> 00:06:46,130
they will be here soon.

102
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:53,610
Fellow cultivator, this is a misunderstanding.

103
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:55,290
There is no grudge between us.

104
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:57,850
We have treated Elder Li well.

105
00:06:58,040 --> 00:07:00,130
We didn't know you were related to Elder Li,

106
00:06:59,880 --> 00:07:01,650
hence the arranged marriage.

107
00:07:01,970 --> 00:07:04,250
Now that the misunderstanding has been cleared,

108
00:07:04,030 --> 00:07:06,250
we can stop here for now.

109
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,170
What do you think ?

110
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:09,890
Sun Zhenwei abused his father's position

111
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,570
to recklessly kill disciples.

112
00:07:11,550 --> 00:07:14,370
He forced Wan'er to marry him.

113
00:07:14,440 --> 00:07:16,990
You all pretended to be blind,

114
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:19,170
yet now you plead for mercy ?

115
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:39,010
Let's drag this fight,

116
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,770
the Ancestors are coming.

117
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,810
This kid,

118
00:07:42,160 --> 00:07:43,450
is dead.

119
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,450
Senior,

120
00:07:51,420 --> 00:07:54,370
the Cloud Sky Sect has 5 Late stage Nascent Soul ancestors.

121
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:55,810
We must leave !

122
00:07:56,030 --> 00:07:57,600
I know...

123
00:08:00,510 --> 00:08:02,760
I'm waiting for them to arrive.

124
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:14,130
Junior is acting up in our Cloud Sky Sect ?

125
00:08:14,520 --> 00:08:16,580
Greetings Ancestors.

126
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:19,230
The Sect has lived for thousands of years,

127
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,730
but this is the first time someone dared attack

128
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:22,890
and kill my Elders.

129
00:08:23,080 --> 00:08:24,130
Junior,

130
00:08:24,220 --> 00:08:26,690
you won't have to wait for death !

131
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:21,010
Chen Bailang
Ancestor of the Cloud Sky Sect
Late stage Nascent Soul

132
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:27,730
Wait,

133
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:30,820
Yun Tianzi
Ancestor of the Cloud Sky Sect
Late Stage Nascent Soul

134
00:08:27,860 --> 00:08:30,370
although he's Early stage Nascent Soul,

135
00:08:30,160 --> 00:08:32,170
his artifact is too strange.

136
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,610
He's not an ordinary person.

137
00:08:33,760 --> 00:08:36,130
Open the Cloud Sky Formation,

138
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:38,490
we must kill this demonic cultivator.

139
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:48,860
The thunder breaks the clouds, the sky becomes your cage.

140
00:09:19,520 --> 00:09:20,570
Die !

141
00:09:27,800 --> 00:09:32,010
As expected, the formation can trap his weird artifact.

142
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:34,490
Liu Fei, you joined the sect late.

143
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:37,850
You've never seen the Cloud Sky Formation in action.

144
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:40,650
It's a gift from a higher rank country.

145
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:42,690
It uses the elements to manipulate space

146
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,210
and trap the enemy.

147
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:48,250
Even a Soul Formation cultivator will be injured if trapped inside.

148
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:53,370
An Early stage Nascent Soul that relies on an artifact

149
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,650
is surely doomed...

150
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:57,930
This formation can manipulate space

151
00:09:57,680 --> 00:09:59,560
to neutralize the Ji Realm.

152
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:02,250
He cannot use his lightning artifact anymore,

153
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:04,690
attack together now !

154
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,850
Senior, be careful !

155
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:42,090
Ancient God Restriction !

156
00:11:06,380 --> 00:11:08,170
Did you say that

157
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,770
I cannot use my artifact anymore ?

158
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:16,210
Ancestors !

159
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,170
The Ancestors...

160
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:26,170
lost...

161
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:29,130
Who the hell are you ?

162
00:11:29,550 --> 00:11:31,690
With your strength,

163
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:34,170
you must not be doing all this

164
00:11:33,920 --> 00:11:35,450
just for a mere alchemist.

165
00:11:35,680 --> 00:11:37,890
Please tell us your purpose !

166
00:11:40,560 --> 00:11:43,050
I want the Cloud Sky Sect.

167
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:49,410
If we can catch the girl,

168
00:11:49,160 --> 00:11:51,090
we still have a chance.

169
00:11:55,880 --> 00:11:57,130
Looking for death ?

170
00:12:09,480 --> 00:12:11,450
Hand over your Soul Blood

171
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:13,010
and I'll spare your life.

172
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:16,610
I have cultivated for more than 1300 years

173
00:12:16,830 --> 00:12:19,410
and have never given anyone my Soul Blood.

174
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,450
If we fight you together,

175
00:12:22,080 --> 00:12:24,290
you won't escape unharmed.

176
00:12:25,040 --> 00:12:27,290
I'd rather die than be humiliated.

177
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:29,250
We will bet our lives !

178
00:12:33,240 --> 00:12:36,410
Fine, don't blame me for it then.

179
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:45,250
Is this...

180
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,890
Divine Retribution ?

181
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:49,570
Even if you join forces,

182
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,370
I wonder

183
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,850
if can you withstand a tribulation ?

184
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:58,410
Every disciple Foundation Establishment and above,

185
00:12:58,200 --> 00:13:00,650
will hand over their Soul Blood

186
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:03,690
or they will die.

187
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,610
Fine,

188
00:13:11,000 --> 00:13:13,610
disciples Foundation Establishment and above,

189
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:16,170
hand over your Soul Blood.

190
00:13:18,760 --> 00:13:20,770
The Cloud Sky Sect

191
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:23,410
is changing owners today...

192
00:13:37,890 --> 00:13:38,930
Senior !

193
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:40,530
What's wrong ?

194
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:45,610
Wan'er, I need you to protect me.

195
00:13:53,030 --> 00:13:53,890
Senior,

196
00:13:54,360 --> 00:13:55,790
Your Nascent Soul...

197
00:13:55,920 --> 00:13:58,050
why is it so weak ?

198
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:00,490
I failed to form my Nascent Soul

199
00:14:00,720 --> 00:14:03,130
so I substituted it with my avatar

200
00:14:03,790 --> 00:14:06,040
to temporarily gain Nascent Soul power.

201
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,280
Then...

202
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:11,090
Your cultivation will decline.

203
00:14:11,600 --> 00:14:14,340
That's why you had to fight the Ancestors immediately ?

204
00:14:17,850 --> 00:14:18,810
Senior...

205
00:14:19,800 --> 00:14:21,140
Don't worry.

206
00:14:21,960 --> 00:14:24,130
My failure is due to the time limit.

207
00:14:25,020 --> 00:14:27,810
Now protect me, I must stabilize my cultivation.

208
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:30,290
Wan'er,

209
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,810
please make me some pills.

210
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:42,650
10 days later

211
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:53,010
Count the specks of time

212
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:56,210
floating down gently.

213
00:14:56,080 --> 00:15:02,330
The carving knife in your hands etches out destiny.

214
00:15:01,720 --> 00:15:02,770
Senior...

215
00:15:03,280 --> 00:15:07,290
Forever lock away the scars

216
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:06,330
Wan'er, we have known each other for many years.

217
00:15:06,080 --> 00:15:07,690
There are some things

218
00:15:07,530 --> 00:15:09,290
that I wish to tell you.

219
00:15:07,040 --> 00:15:09,890
of this mortal life.

220
00:15:09,740 --> 00:15:16,250
This fleeting youth is a thing of the past.

221
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:15,410
I am not from the Burning Fire Country.

222
00:15:15,230 --> 00:15:17,570
I come from a remote country named Zhao.

223
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:19,570
The flying bird could not escape the twilight

224
00:15:19,320 --> 00:15:21,330
that fills the sky

225
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:24,390
with a myriad of colors.

226
00:15:24,160 --> 00:15:26,730
The night-blooming flower cannot drink

227
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:31,290
the crystalization of the golden wind and the jade dew.

228
00:15:31,400 --> 00:15:33,410
I asked the heavens who exactly

229
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:35,290
Noooo !!!

230
00:15:33,160 --> 00:15:35,490
sliced open this world

231
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:38,250
to let the rain fall in.

232
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:40,490
I will refine the world

233
00:15:40,240 --> 00:15:42,930
to make our palm lines say

234
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:45,410
that we will live forever.

235
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:49,530
Are you going to return to Zhao now ?

236
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:51,800
Yes,

237
00:15:52,120 --> 00:15:53,610
because if I don't,

238
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:54,930
I'm unfilial.

239
00:15:57,050 --> 00:15:59,010
You should come with me as well.

240
00:15:59,760 --> 00:16:01,450
If I come to Zhao...

241
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:03,850
I will only be a burden.

242
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,810
I want to stay in the Cloud Sky Sect

243
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,810
so that I can improve my alchemy.

244
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:12,810
Only here do I have the right conditions to try to refine grade 6 pills.

245
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:15,680
That way I can be useful to you in the future.

246
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:17,810
Chu has many factions,

247
00:16:17,640 --> 00:16:20,090
the Cloud Sky Sect is not safe,

248
00:16:20,240 --> 00:16:21,090
you...

249
00:16:21,160 --> 00:16:23,970
I have been in the Cloud Sky Sect for a long time

250
00:16:23,870 --> 00:16:26,330
so I can take care of these things myself.

251
00:17:05,440 --> 00:17:08,850
I will manage the Cloud Sky Sect for my husband.

252
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:11,050
I hope Seniors will take care of me.

253
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:42,250
Ancestors,

254
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:44,110
your status is very noble

255
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:47,010
so please don’t take the matter of the Soul Blood to heart.

256
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:48,530
In 500 years,

257
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:50,370
Wan'er will return it to you.

258
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:52,650
To apologize,

259
00:17:52,710 --> 00:17:55,570
I will make pills that will increase your lifespan

260
00:17:55,360 --> 00:17:57,530
and gift them to you.

261
00:17:57,600 --> 00:18:00,570
Each pill increases life by 50 years.

262
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:05,290
A pill that increases lifespan !?

263
00:18:05,050 --> 00:18:06,050
Quick,

264
00:18:05,800 --> 00:18:07,250
give it to me !

265
00:18:09,000 --> 00:18:09,930
Did...

266
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:13,170
Did you really make this pill ?

267
00:18:13,120 --> 00:18:15,010
I refined this pill,

268
00:18:14,880 --> 00:18:17,370
but the materials were provided by my husband.

269
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:20,030
Rich spiritual energy...

270
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:21,650
a fragrant smell...

271
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:23,650
This is at least a grade 5 pill !

272
00:18:23,920 --> 00:18:26,890
Elder Li refined this herself ?

273
00:18:26,850 --> 00:18:28,880
I admire you !

274
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:31,610
You can become the Sect Leader ! I don't mind.

275
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:34,650
Elder Li is very proficient at alchemy.

276
00:18:35,680 --> 00:18:37,770
You taking charge of the Cloud Sky Sect

277
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:39,760
is a blessing in disguise.

278
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:43,960
Little friend, you gave her our Soul Blood,

279
00:18:43,930 --> 00:18:45,970
you can leave this place safely.

280
00:18:46,360 --> 00:18:48,210
You can rest assured,

281
00:18:47,960 --> 00:18:50,610
I will keep her safe for 500 years !

282
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:11,450
Teng Huayuan...

283
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:14,010
I, Wang Lin,

284
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:15,970
am coming back.

285
00:19:18,520 --> 00:21:34,840
Wang Lin is pretty chill about his "failed" breakthrough, however it's quite a big deal.
Here is the sequence of events:

-Wang Lin has a Ji Realm cultivation that he unlocked by accident back when Teng Huayuan killed his parents. This type of cultivation is very strong but no known cultivators (neither alive nor in the ancient records of planet Suzaku) have ever reached a level above Nascent Soul with it.

-Wang Lin reconstructs his original body thanks to the memories of the Ancient God and then goes back to Ma Liang's corpse to retrieve his Golden Core to continue to cultivate. At that point the Ji Realm is both in his soul and his new body.

-After trying to reach Nascent Soul once and understanding that the Ji Realm is preventing him from advancing further, Wang Lin decides to use the Divine Path to create an avatar of himself (which is free from the Ji Realm as he has to cultivate from scratch with a new body) in order to merge with it.

-The avatar cultivates up to the Nascent Soul breakthrough and then when it merges with the original body, the Ji Realm still prevents the Nascent Soul from forming naturally. In order to circumvent this limitation, Wang Lin undergoes the breakthrough only with his avatar, which reaches Nascent Soul without issues, and then puts his Nascent Soul avatar inside his Ancient God body to use its Nascent Soul cultivation instead of the original body's Core Formation cultivation.

-With this convoluted method, Wang Lin is able to use the Ji Realm at Nascent Soul level but with a great cost of spiritual energy. This is only a temporary solution because now Wang Lin is completely stuck and cannot advance his cultivation anymore.

286
00:19:27,300 --> 00:19:31,430
I've had my share of wounds,

287
00:19:29,340 --> 00:19:31,430
now I want to fight back.

288
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:34,990
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

289
00:19:34,820 --> 00:19:40,910
that's blocking all my hopes

290
00:19:37,700 --> 00:19:40,910
for life ?

291
00:19:42,460 --> 00:19:46,670
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

292
00:19:44,180 --> 00:19:46,670
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

293
00:19:46,740 --> 00:19:50,070
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

294
00:19:50,180 --> 00:19:56,070
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

295
00:19:52,900 --> 00:19:56,070
out of reach.

296
00:19:57,180 --> 00:20:01,550
Immortals

297
00:19:58,220 --> 00:20:01,550
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

298
00:20:01,580 --> 00:20:05,590
Renegades

299
00:20:02,340 --> 00:20:05,590
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

300
00:20:05,340 --> 00:20:09,430
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

301
00:20:07,290 --> 00:20:09,430
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

302
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:13,550
because I don't see the harm in that.

303
00:20:15,300 --> 00:20:21,350
My new body opens its eyes

304
00:20:17,820 --> 00:20:21,350
and awakens from its dream.

305
00:20:21,220 --> 00:20:28,910
I have overcome many trials

306
00:20:23,340 --> 00:20:28,910
to get this body back.

307
00:20:28,860 --> 00:20:36,550
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

308
00:20:32,900 --> 00:20:36,550
I can still see.

309
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:45,910
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

310
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:45,910
by my own hands.

311
00:21:01,100 --> 00:21:07,310
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

312
00:21:03,820 --> 00:21:07,310
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

313
00:21:07,060 --> 00:21:14,870
With a flick of a finger,

314
00:21:08,500 --> 00:21:14,870
only my indomitable heart remains.

315
00:21:14,660 --> 00:21:24,270
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

316
00:21:20,620 --> 00:21:24,270
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

317
00:21:24,260 --> 00:21:32,110
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

318
00:21:26,780 --> 00:21:32,110
like the descent of a god.
